---
config:
  theme: base
  fontFamily: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif
  themeVariables:
    fontFamily: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif
    actorBkg: "#CFE4FA"
    actorBorder: "#0078D4"
    actorTextColor: "#000000"
    actorLineColor: "#8A8886"
    signalColor: "#1E1E1E"
    signalTextColor: "#000000"
    labelBoxBkgColor: "#F3F2F1"
    labelBoxBorderColor: "#8A8886"
    labelTextColor: "#000000"
    loopTextColor: "#000000"
  sequence:
    mirrorActors: false
    useMaxWidth: false
    diagramMarginX: 20
    diagramMarginY: 10
    actorFontFamily: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif
    messageFontFamily: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif
    noteFontFamily: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif
    actorFontSize: 16
    messageFontSize: 16
---
sequenceDiagram
    actor You
    participant D as Dashboard
    participant S as Web server
    participant R as Live runner<br/>(Copilot SDK)
    participant H as HydraFusion<br/>(GitHub Copilot)
    participant B as Browser tools<br/>(Playwright MCP)

    You->>D: Run live
    D->>S: Start the demo
    S->>R: New session on the tier
    R->>H: Prompt and shared page
    H->>H: Pick a pattern and models
    loop Each pass
        H->>R: Tool calls, if needed
        R->>B: Test the demo page
        B-->>R: Results
        R-->>H: Results
    end
    H-->>R: Answer, route and cost
    R-->>S: Events (route, passes, cost)
    S-->>D: New events (long polling)
    S->>S: Save the run for replay
    D-->>You: Workflow, passes and cost
